# Prompt caching and reuse

Caching can reduce repeated prompt resolution or provider work, but it must not hide which prompt version a run used. Keep the version identifier on the generation span even when the content comes from a cache.

Measure cache behavior beside quality, cost, and latency. Invalidate or bypass cached content when promoting a new environment label or investigating a suspected prompt regression.
